% simple representation of base pair sequence


dna atom 4          % we have 4 types of atoms, red, green, blue & white
dna atom shape 0    % the shape is a sphere
% usage of the following four commands is:
% dna atom ATOMTYPE RADIUS RED GREEN BLUE
dna atom 0 1 1 0 0  % adenine
dna atom 1 1 0 1 0  % thymine
dna atom 2 1 0 0 1  % guanine
dna atom 3 1 1 1 1  % cytosine

dna base 4       % we have 4 types of base pairs
% usage of the following four commands is:
% dna base BASETYPE DEFINITIONFILE
dna base 0 adenine-simple.txt
dna base 1 thymine-simple.txt
dna base 2 guanine-simple.txt
dna base 3 cytosine-simple.txt

% draw as fancy atoms rather than simple slabs
dna draw fancy
